  "description": "Stock Market Weekly Wrap Up - Bull Market Week 17",
  "body_html": "<p>I always give you 100% of what is on my mind…not hiding my thoughts and feelings with the markets, in an attempt to create this fake persona of perfection as a trader…a plague amongst online trading personalities. And yesterday I was second guessing myself, asking: </p><ul><li><p>“Why did I sell?!”</p></li><li><p>“Was that the best move?!”</p></li><li><p>“What is (insert name) doing?!”</p></li></ul><p>I had to step back and remind myself of the “why”: <em><strong>To capture profits</strong></em> 💸</p><p>It stung a little bit to watch things like <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;BABA&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> and <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;KTOS&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>  keep on running. But what is to be mad about with a 22% and 24% profit in such a short time? Other positions like <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;XMTR&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>, had I not sold would have went from +3% to -11%. The point being is, its always easy in hindsight. Woulda Shoulda Coulda!</p><p>Additionally, no one in the entire world knows when or where the market will top at. Maybe it is today….maybe it is in a year. Shake your magic eight ball for clearer guidance! But when the music stops, the vast majority of people will not have a chair to sit in. The stock market musical chairs, always has way less chairs than players at the end. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GrFY!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8173c4a1-3c5b-4932-ae10-da9b69d5aa6c_600x401.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GrFY!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8173c4a1-3c5b-4932-ae10-da9b69d5aa6c_600x401.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GrFY!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8173c4a1-3c5b-4932-ae10-da9b69d5aa6c_600x401.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GrFY!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8173c4a1-3c5b-4932-ae10-da9b69d5aa6c_600x401.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GrFY!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8173c4a1-3c5b-4932-ae10-da9b69d5aa6c_600x401.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GrFY!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8173c4a1-3c5b-4932-ae10-da9b69d5aa6c_600x401.jpeg\" width=\"600\" height=\"401\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8173c4a1-3c5b-4932-ae10-da9b69d5aa6c_600x401.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:401,&quot;width&quot;:600,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Musical Chairs – Party Game Ideas&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Musical Chairs – Party Game Ideas\" title=\"Musical Chairs – Party Game Ideas\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GrFY!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8173c4a1-3c5b-4932-ae10-da9b69d5aa6c_600x401.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GrFY!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8173c4a1-3c5b-4932-ae10-da9b69d5aa6c_600x401.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GrFY!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8173c4a1-3c5b-4932-ae10-da9b69d5aa6c_600x401.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GrFY!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8173c4a1-3c5b-4932-ae10-da9b69d5aa6c_600x401.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Are you going to have a chair when the stock market music stops?</figcaption></figure></div><p><strong>I sold, because I respect ALL price action weakness at this stage in the market.</strong></p><p>The primary goal, is to keep you (and me) out of a far larger market crash…which if you do not know me, my analysis leads me to think we have a melt-down, a massive crash in the markets. These come after a melt-up…something we had from 2023 through 2024. And right now we are in the blow off top stage. If you are unfamiliar, a melt up is when the markets rise under poor economic conditions and low volume. The blow off top is the final phase. Then, due to the low volume and low institutional support, the crashes are far more devastating. The best example of this, in my opinion, is the Nikkei from 1987. Even the chart structure is similar to our present day market. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EbwB!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4359e8fc-1d0a-47b6-af69-ebe442e5bbcc_787x549.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EbwB!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4359e8fc-1d0a-47b6-af69-ebe442e5bbcc_787x549.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EbwB!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4359e8fc-1d0a-47b6-af69-ebe442e5bbcc_787x549.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EbwB!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4359e8fc-1d0a-47b6-af69-ebe442e5bbcc_787x549.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EbwB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4359e8fc-1d0a-47b6-af69-ebe442e5bbcc_787x549.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EbwB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4359e8fc-1d0a-47b6-af69-ebe442e5bbcc_787x549.png\" width=\"787\" height=\"549\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/4359e8fc-1d0a-47b6-af69-ebe442e5bbcc_787x549.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:549,&quot;width&quot;:787,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:121105,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/175186838?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4359e8fc-1d0a-47b6-af69-ebe442e5bbcc_787x549.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EbwB!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4359e8fc-1d0a-47b6-af69-ebe442e5bbcc_787x549.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EbwB!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4359e8fc-1d0a-47b6-af69-ebe442e5bbcc_787x549.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EbwB!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4359e8fc-1d0a-47b6-af69-ebe442e5bbcc_787x549.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EbwB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4359e8fc-1d0a-47b6-af69-ebe442e5bbcc_787x549.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">By respecting all price action weakness, we will (theoretically) avoid the larger scale drawdown. The Nikkei from 1987 is the best example of a melt-up, blow off top and then melt-down.</figcaption></figure></div><p>So yea…I questioned my move a little bit. I am human and would have loved to see a bit more gains. But no one, including me, can complain about taking profits off the table. We can always, gradually, accumulate more names. </p><p>Here are the other articles mentioned in the video:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/recession-resistant-stock-buy\">Why I am only interested in “Recession Resistant” stocks right now</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://substack.com/home/post/p-175147313\">Jason Shapiro’s “Is it time to short the market?”</a></p></li></ul><p>Not mentioned in the video, but relevant Stock Market thoughts from this week if you missed it:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-market-guessing-game?r=4z8lgl\">The Stock Market is a guessing game right now, why its riskier than usual</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/high-risk-high-reward-stock-buy?r=4z8lgl\">A degenerate hype stock I see potential in</a></p></li></ul><p>If you have different thoughts…swing by the chat! Sharing ideas and thoughts has often times aided all of our portfolios! <strong>I am available in the chat during market hours for any questions or commentary. </strong></p><h3>Please note<a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/a27b2288-ae6c-4cb6-833a-bfb84d676813\">, I purchased 1 stock this morning and you can view it in the “Quick Notes” thread in the Chat.</a></h3><p>Hope you have a great weekend…take the time to recharge! Last but not least…THANKS FOR STOPPING BY! 👍</p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok?utm_source=user-menu\">StockTok Main Page</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Positions</a> |</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>Other Resources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
